+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use LRU (Least Recently Used) eviction with a 300-second TTL for cache entries, prioritizing recency of access combined with explicit TTL-based expiration; this decision replaced an earlier LFU (Least Frequently Used) selection.
